-raj-niwas-raj-bhavan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">Government of Goa — Cabo Raj Niwas</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Documented history of the Cabo peninsula.</p></a><a class="card p-5" href="https://lokbhavan.goa.gov.in/node/399" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">Lok Bhavan — Chapel / Dona Paula traditions</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Paula Menezes reference and caution that popular stories remain conjectural.</p></a><a class="card p-5" href="https://ktclgoa.com/ev-buses-in-smart-city-panaji/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">Kadamba Transport Corporation</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Public bus information for Panaji and Dona Paula.</p></a><a class="card p-5" href={MAPS_SHARE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">Google Maps listing — {ATTRACTION_FULL_NAME}</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Address, map pin, rating and seven-day hours snapshot, checked 20 October 2026.</p></a><a class="card p-5" href={GOVT_TOURISM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">{GOVT_TOURISM_LABEL}</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Official updates and regional tourism information for {STATE_PROVINCE}, {COUNTRY_NAME}.</p></a></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-[#6a7775]">Photographs are historical views, not evidence of today’s access or operating conditions. See the linked credits below.</p></div></section>
